  "solution": {
    "text": "$-\\mathrm{NO}_2$ and -Cl are written as prefixes with $\\mathrm{CH}_3$ being given the highest preference for numbering $(\\mathrm{C}-1)$.\nThus, the name of the compound will be $2-$ chloro-1-methyl-4-nitrobenzene."
